      "Walk is the spec's 4-frame hop (crouch, rise, air, land); the land squash holds a second frame and the lid comes back down, so it reads REST, not bouncy ROAM.",
      "Growth stages (rig variants of the same poses): 1 the curled leaf; 2 a second, smaller leaf at the joint; 3 a bud opening at the curl. The joint never moves.",
      "Perch: a 16 px redraw, the leaf curled back and down to clear small folk; it turns to the foe (E and W). perchAnchor is the foot line centre (12, 22).",
      "Moss: round leaf_cool mounds on a warm leaf_warm skin, never on grey stone (Cairn) and never in rows (Tam's knit). The leaf is fresh grass_warm, stiff and curled, not a floppy cap (Mote).",
      "Open for Matt: cling and special sit at 14 px (squashed / leaf lowered as a guard); react is 26 px with the leaf raised. The idle and the perch are on target (24 and 16).",
      "Compared with Eastward-04 (Sam scaled to 24 px): her 2-3 px hair clumps for the moss, 3-4 tones a material, a dark per-material outline and a glinting eye block."
